<p>Inktober: one image per day from a list of prompts. Last year I made it to day 20 before running out of steam but was proud of myself for getting that far. Let’s see what this year brings!</p>
<p>I’ve set a personal constraint of only using combinations of the letters of the word, within a 2-inch square, to illustrate each concept. Much artistic license taken with letter shapes, of course! I’ll be using the same pen as last year: a Hongdian Black Forest fountain pen, extra fine nib, black ink.</p>
